/-! Pure integral matrix identities for the four root-eight forest letters.

The letters are the conjugates `T⁻¹ g T` of the two reduced Mathieu words, the point mover and
the mate orientation by the canonical transport `T` of the root-eight flag. Here only the
integral basis matrices of their literal factors are displayed and multiplied out; the
identification of the factors with genuine Leech isometries is made separately. -/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
namespace FormalizedTextbooks.FrenkelLepowskyMeurmanMonster
open scoped Matrix

/-- The physical matrix of a coordinate permutation given by its forward array. -/
def rootEightSpatialPermutationPhysical (a : Fin 24 → Fin 24) :
    Matrix (Fin 24) (Fin 24) ℤ :=
  Matrix.of fun i j => if a j = i then 1 else 0

